      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大長老",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蔓珠院の権威を、揺るがぬものとし……イェラグの民の、蔓珠院への忠誠を……永遠のものと、したかった……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大長老",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
